    <item>
      <title>Apple 悄然取消 Flyover 城市導覽　地圖 3D 影像功能仍保留</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2025/12/21/apple-maps-flyover-tours-discontinued/software/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=apple-maps-flyover-tours-discontinued</link>
      <description>早前有網民發現，Apple Maps 原來已悄悄地取消提供自動導覽主要城市地標的 Flyover Tours 功能，Apple 方面並未在任何版本更新公告中提及此事。據報導，這項改變是在 iOS 18 推出後生效，但一直未受廣泛關注。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2025/12/21/apple-maps-flyover-tours-discontinued/software/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=apple-maps-flyover-tours-discontinued</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 12:00:15 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
